语对话", "from": 49.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 20, "to": 52.57}, {"content": "这样可以吗", "from": 52.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 21, "to": 53.91}, {"content": "当然可以", "from": 53.91, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 22, "to": 55.09}, {"content": "其实我希望你能做我的朋友", "from": 55.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 23, "to": 57.13}, {"content": "用英语和我聊天", "from": 57.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 24, "to": 60.0}, {"content": "就像真实生活中的对话一样", "from": 60.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 25, "to": 64.61}, {"content": "同时我也希望你能当我的英语老师", "from": 64.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 26, "to": 68.74}, {"content": "呃", "from": 68.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 27, "to": 69.22}, {"content": "有时候我不知道如何准确表达自己", "from": 69.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 28, "to": 73.32}, {"content": "你可以纠正我让我的表达更自然", "from": 73.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 29, "to": 78.44}, {"content": "还有啊", "from": 79.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 30, "to": 82.19}, {"content": "给我一些反馈", "from": 82.19, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 31, "to": 83.39}, {"content": "如何提升我的英语口语能力", "from": 83.39, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 32, "to": 86.81}, {"content": "这样可以吗", "from": 86.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 33, "to": 88.28}, {"content": "当然完美", "from": 88.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 34, "to": 90.94}, {"content": "我们就像朋友一样聊天", "from": 90.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 35, "to": 93.04}, {"content": "她会适时纠正你的英语", "from": 93.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 36, "to": 95.32}, {"content": "在需要的时候", "from": 95.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 37, "to": 95.98}, {"content": "你只需自然表达", "from": 95.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 38, "to": 98.55}, {"content": "接下来停止说话", "from": 98.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 39, "to": 100.43}, {"content": "基本上我有两种练习方式", "from": 100.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 40, "to": 103.47}, {"content": "第一种是和她聊天", "from": 103.47, "location": 2, "mus