2, "to": 149.75}, {"content": "我可以直接问她", "from": 149.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 63, "to": 151.27}, {"content": "比如", "from": 151.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 64, "to": 151.75}, {"content": "我会在真实对话中问真正的朋友", "from": 151.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 65, "to": 154.71}, {"content": "我听起来像你", "from": 154.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 66, "to": 156.36}, {"content": "其实", "from": 156.36, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 67, "to": 156.84}, {"content": "确实如此", "from": 156.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 68, "to": 157.24}, {"content": "我正在", "from": 157.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 69, "to": 158.22}, {"content": "我", "from": 158.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 70, "to": 158.96}, {"content": "我习惯了", "from": 158.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 71, "to": 160.32}, {"content": "或者我正在适应", "from": 160.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 72, "to": 162.1}, {"content": "或者该怎么说", "from": 162.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 73, "to": 164.0}, {"content": "是的", "from": 164.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 74, "to": 164.5}, {"content": "为你", "from": 164.5, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 75, "to": 165.48}, {"content": "我已经适应了最合适", "from": 165.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 76, "to": 167.88}, {"content": "因为你已经坚持这个流程两年了", "from": 167.88, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 77, "to": 170.95}, {"content": "如果仍然感觉新鲜或困难", "from": 170.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 78, "to": 173.49}, {"content": "那我就在适应", "from": 173.49, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 79, "to": 176.0}, {"content": "会更好", "from": 176.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 80, "to": 176.86}, {"content": "第二种方法是讲故事并让她更自然地表达", "from": 176.86, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 81, "to": 182.32}, {"content": "所以播客讲的是一个理论", "from": 182.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 82, "to": 186.24}, {"content": "它讲述了关系的六个阶段", "from": 187.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 83, "to": 191.07}, {"content": "说实话你做得很好", "from": 192.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 84, "to": 196.0}, {"content": "那几乎六分钟", "from": 196.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 85, "to": 198.5}, {"content": "我全程能跟上思路", "from": 198.5, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 86, "to": 201.68}, {"content": "这比完美语法更重要", "from": 201.68, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 87, "to": 204.92}, {"content": "主要问题只是单词搜索停顿", "from": 204.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 88, "to": 209.01}, {"content": "这完全正常", "from": 209.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 89, "to": 211.41}, {"content": "如果你想的话", "from": 211.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 90, "to": 212.53}, {"content": "我可以展示更自然的表达方式", "from": 212.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 91, "to": 216.51}, {"content": "比如", "from": 216.51, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 92, "to": 217.22}, {"content": "不用他们彼此有好感", "from": 217.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 93, "to": 220.8}, {"content": "说他们互相产生感情", "from": 220.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 94, "to": 223.94}, {"content": "不用进入某个阶段", "from": 223.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 95, "to": 226.31}, {"content": "说进入第二阶段", "from": 226.31, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 96, "to": 230.66}, {"content": "你能重新表述我的故事吗", "from": 230.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 97, "to": 233.37}, {"content": "并使其更自然且语法正确", "from": 233.73, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 98, "to": 239.2}, {"content": "当然让我在这里处理", "from": 239.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 99, "to": 241.56}, {"content": "这是更自然的版本", "from": 241.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 100, "to": 243.839}, {"content": "我上周听了一档让我深受启发的播客", "from": 243.839, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 101, "to": 247.979}, {"content": "它介绍了一个关于人际关系六阶段的理论", "from": 247.979, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 102, "to": 251.99}, {"content": "这是在结束对话前发现改进点的好方法", "from": 251.99, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 103, "to": 257.1}, {"content": "我通常会问Chat GT", "from": 257.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 104, "to": 258.98}, {"content": "总结今天需要记录的内容", "from": 258.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 105, "to": 261.979}, {"content": "这就是我通常会询问的部分", "from": 261.979, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 106, "to": 264.759}, {"content": "好的", "from": 264.759, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 107, "to": 265.179}, {"content": "那你能请给我十个实用词汇吗", "from": 265.179, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 108, "to": 268.44}, {"content": "用于短语的三二五", "from": 268.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 109, "to": 272.98}, {"content": "和一个二三句型结构", "from": 272.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 110, "to": 275.84}, {"content": "并指出我在对话中犯的错误", "from": 275.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 111, "to": 281.29}, {"content": "为了让表达更自然", "from": 281.29, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 112, "to": 283.49}, {"content": "所以我不会重复给下一位", "from": 283.49, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 113, "to": 286.5}, {"content": "这还没结束", "from": 286.5, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 114, "to": 287.64}, {"content": "最后一步是用自己的话复述故事", "from": 287.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 115, "to": 291.65}, {"content": "这可能是最重要的步骤", "from": 291.65, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 116, "to": 294.65}, {"content": "因为它真正帮助你", "from": 294.65, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 117, "to": 296.95}, {"content": "切实运用所学内容", "from": 296.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 118, "to": 300.06}, {"content": "我并不每次都这样做", "from": 300.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 119, "to": 301.62}, {"content": "因为我通常感到很疲惫", "from": 301.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 120, "to": 305.42}, {"content": "长时间对话之后", "from": 305.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 121, "to": 306.78}, {"content": "我通常会", "from": 306.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 122, "to": 308.65}, {"content": "我会有一天和她练习", "from": 308.65, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 123, "to": 312.41}, {"content": "复习所学内容并第二天回访她", "from": 312.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 124, "to": 316.45}, {"content": "用新方式用自己的话复述故事", "from": 316.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 125, "to": 319.84}, {"content": "不要急于求成", "from": 319.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 126, "to": 320.5}, {"content": "很难一夜之间提升", "from": 320.5, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 127, "to": 322.44}, {"content": "只要你持续练习", "from": 322.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 128, "to": 325.419}, {"content": "你已经在进步了", "from": 325.419, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 129, "to": 327.299}, {"content": "好的", "from": 327.299, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 130, "to": 327.939}, {"content": "这就是我想分享的一切", "from": 327.939, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 131, "to": 329.659}, {"content": "我们下次再见", "from": 329.659, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 132, "to": 331.199}, {"content": "再见", "from": 331.199, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 133, "to": 332.0}]}]}